athena-base-files (1.0.1) thor; urgency=low

  * Fix /etc/issue and /etc/issue.net landing at <path>.dpkg-dist
    instead of the canonical path on first install.
    Root cause: base-files marks both as conffiles; shipping our
    versions under /etc made debhelper auto-mark them as conffiles
    on our side too — dpkg's conffile-conflict logic, combined with
    the preinst-diverted upstream file already moved away, resolved
    by saving our shipped content as .dpkg-dist and leaving the
    canonical path empty.  /etc/motd was unaffected (not a conffile
    in base-files).
    Fix: ship all four identity files under /usr/share/athena-base-
    files/ (no conffile machinery in /usr/share) and copy them
    into the canonical paths from postinst.  preinst's dpkg-divert
    still runs so future base-files upgrades route their /etc/issue
    to .upstream instead of overwriting our content.

 -- Athena Linux <athena@local>  Wed, 21 May 2026 19:00:00 +0000

athena-base-files (1.0.0) thor; urgency=low

  * Initial release.
    - Ships rebranded /etc/issue, /etc/issue.net, /etc/motd,
      /usr/lib/os-release with @DISTRIBUTION@ identity strings.
    - Uses dpkg-divert (preinst install/upgrade + prerm remove)
      to displace the upstream base-files versions while leaving
      base-files itself (Essential) installed.
  * @DISTRIBUTION@ identity in /usr/lib/os-release: NAME, ID,
    PRETTY_NAME, VERSION_CODENAME populated from build-time tokens.
    LOGO=asgard wires the user-icon and About-panel logo to the
    asgard.svg pixmap shipped by athena-branding.

 -- Athena Linux <athena@local>  Wed, 21 May 2026 17:30:00 +0000
